And so I took the time, figure it out, try some things, eventually figured it out.

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:34.180
It's a fine game.

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:35.120
I'm happy to report.

00:01:35.120 --> 00:01:38.380
I did get further than the very first set of enemies.

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:44.020
That's really big of you, Mike, to just know that it had to have been you.

