00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:56.560
Like, it's not even like there's some kind of, you know, oh, I was playing and I was getting

00:01:56.560 --> 00:02:01.880
by, but then eventually, like, there was just too many enemies and I wasn't shooting correctly,

