00:03:55.640 --> 00:04:00.260
You know what? It didn't take long, but it was a sort of, like, aha moment.

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:05.220
So maybe we're just dumb enough to be able to experience that aha moment.

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:09.360
See, I had almost, like, the opposite of an aha moment, because I was playing for a while,

