00:16:37.560 --> 00:16:41.680
feel powerful and shmups and everything, but I actually question if they did it too fast

00:16:41.680 --> 00:16:42.800
here. Um.

00:16:42.920 --> 00:16:48.620
Like even in Gradius, a game where like, you know, in a single stage you can get, uh, most

00:16:48.620 --> 00:16:51.980
of the power ups by carefully collecting all the options.

00:16:52.160 --> 00:16:56.220
