00:19:31.660 --> 00:19:32.480
And I don't know.

00:19:32.540 --> 00:19:35.880
I feel like it sort of robs a little bit of the fun sometimes where I'm like, well, I

00:19:35.880 --> 00:19:39.740
don't want to use any of this cool stuff I've got because I'll probably absolutely need

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:41.180
it when I fight a boss.

