00:19:45.760 --> 00:19:49.460
get the best of both worlds where, you know, you, there's one that works better on bosses

00:19:49.460 --> 00:19:51.920
and one that works on, you know, regular enemies.

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:55.760
But this was still, um, I think a step in the right direction.

00:19:56.060 --> 00:20:00.800
Right. And, and Sean mentioned, you know, that as you collect the power-ups, um, if you're not

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:03.820
fully maxed out, you switch to that weapon.

